          initial cell state for each element in the input sequence.
          Defaults to zeros if (h_0, c_0) is not provided.

        where:

        .. math::
            \begin{aligned}
                N ={} & \text{batch size} \\
                L ={} & \text{sequence length} \\
                D ={} & 2 \text{ if bidirectional=True otherwise } 1 \\
                H_{in} ={} & \text{input\_size} \\
